        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "22e19b78-eb7a-540d-bfbe-5c2fe51a9475",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2011 FA Community Shield\n- Organizations: Manchester United, Manchester City, Premier League, FA Cup, England national team\n- People: Chris Smalling, Nani, Joleon Lescott, Edin Džeko\n- Roles: centre-back\n\nFacts:\n- The 2011 FA Community Shield was the 89th FA Community Shield, an annual football match between the winners of the previous season's Premier League and FA Cup competitions.\n- Manchester United won the 2011 FA Community Shield 3–2 against Manchester City after trailing 2–0 at half-time.\n- In the 2011 FA Community Shield, Joleon Lescott and Edin Džeko scored for Manchester City before half-time, and Chris Smalling and Nani scored Manchester United's goals, with Nani scoring twice.\n- Chris Smalling was born on 22 November 1989.\n- Chris Smalling is an English professional footballer who plays as a centre-back for Manchester United and the England national team.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "db9814a3-6001-5dad-a80a-d72d252aa1f8",
        "text": "Page: 2011 FA Community Shield. Sentence: The 2011 FA Community Shield was the 89th FA Community Shield, an annual football match contested by the winners of the previous season's Premier League and FA Cup competitions.\nPage: 2011 FA Community Shield. Sentence: Manchester United won the game 3–2, with goals from Chris Smalling and Nani (2), after Joleon Lescott and Edin Džeko had put City 2–0 up at half-time.\nPage: Chris Smalling. Sentence: Christopher Lloyd Smalling (born 22 November 1989) is an English professional footballer who plays as a centre-back for Premier League club Manchester United and the England national team.",
